<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Nature Memories | My Image Gallery</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

</head><body><!-- ================= HEADER ================= -->
<header class="hero">

    <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="welcome">✦ WELCOME TO MY GALLERY ✦</p>

        <h1>Nature<br><span>Memories</span></h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
            A collection of beautiful places, peaceful views,
            and moments worth remembering.
        </p>

        <a href="#gallery" class="explore-btn">
            ~Explore My Photos↓
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-text">
        SCROLL TO EXPLORE
    </div>

</header>


<!-- ================= INTRODUCTION ================= -->
<section class="intro">

    <div class="intro-photo">
        <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80"
            alt="Beautiful nature landscape"
        >
    </div>

    <div class="intro-content">

        <p class="section-label">01 — ABOUT THIS GALLERY</p>

        <h2>
            Every picture
            <span>has a story.</span>
        </h2>

        <p>
            Welcome to my image gallery! This website contains
            beautiful views of nature, mountains, beaches,
            forests, and peaceful places.
        </p>

        <p>
            I created this project using HTML and CSS.
            I used <strong>float, CSS Grid, position,
            z-index, hover effects</strong>, and responsive design.
        </p>

        <div class="signature">
            — My Creative Collection
        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= FLOAT SECTION ================= -->
<section class="float-section">

    <div class="float-card">

        <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80"
            alt="Beautiful forest"
            class="float-image"
        >

        <h2>A Little Piece of Nature 🌿</h2>

        <p>
            Nature gives us peaceful moments. Sometimes,
            a simple view of trees, mountains, or water
            can become a beautiful memory.
        </p>

        <div class="clear"></div>

    </div>

</section>


